  <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
  <p>This Privacy Policy describes how blog.gbacon.com (the "Site") collects, uses, and protects
  visitor information. This is a personal academic blog with minimal data collection.</p>

  <h3>Information Collected</h3>
  <p>The Site does not collect personally identifiable information from casual visitors unless
  you voluntarily provide it (for example, by contacting the author directly).</p>

  <p>Like most websites, this Site automatically collects certain non-personal information, including:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>IP address (anonymized where possible)</li>
    <li>Browser type and version</li>
    <li>Operating system</li>
    <li>Referring website</li>
    <li>Pages visited and time spent on the Site</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Cookies and Analytics</h3>
  <p>This Site uses <strong>Google Analytics</strong> to understand visitor trends and improve content. Google Analytics collects anonymized data using cookies. You can opt out of Google Analytics tracking by visiting the
  <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</p>

  <p>This Site may use other essential cookies for basic functionality (e.g., remembering theme preference if applicable).</p>

  <h3>Amazon Associates</h3>
  <p>This Site participates in the Amazon Associates Program. When you click on affiliate links and make qualifying purchases, I may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. See the Amazon Associates section above for details.</p>

  <p>Amazon may set cookies and collect data on its own sites when you interact with affiliate links. Their data practices are governed by the
  <a href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=468496" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Amazon Privacy Notice</a>.</p>

