  <p>This Site contains links to third-party websites (including Amazon). I am not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites. Please review their privacy policies.</p>

  <h3>Data Sharing and Security</h3>
  <p>I do not sell personal data. Data collected via Google Analytics is shared only with Google under their terms. I take reasonable measures to protect the Site, but no website is completely secure.</p>

  <h3>Changes to This Policy</h3>
  <p>I may update this Privacy Policy occasionally. The "Last updated" date at the top will reflect any changes. Continued use of the Site after changes constitutes acceptance of the new policy.</p>

  <h3>Data Rights</h3>
  <p>Because this Site collects minimal personal information (primarily anonymized analytics data), individual data access or deletion requests are rarely applicable. However, you may reach out regarding privacy concerns using any public contact method you find on this site.</p>
